  "description": "Gonthina is a twin-tower fort in brown with green tube slides. A rope bridge links the two towers, spiral slides come down each side, and a net tunnel gives a crawling route between them. The design suits play that moves between two bases, such as two teams holding a tower each. The listed colours are Sea Green and Forest Green. Gonthina covers 42'7\" x 27'11\" and needs a safe play area of 48'7\" x 33'11\", so it is planned for large parks and township grounds. Our sheet lists room for 80 to 99 children at once. Making connections, taking on challenges and self-directed play are its listed skills. Our 3-year warranty covers its main materials. Ask us for a layout drawing.",
